  "description": "Paper Plane is a double-decker play tower styled as a folded paper plane. Red and purple wing platforms, star-shaped from above, sit either side of a central climbing net, and long Lemon Yellow slides bring children down. The two decks are slightly inclined, so children climb up the middle, choose a deck and slide off as if landing. It is designed for ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children. The tower covers 24'4\" x 12'2\" and needs a safe play area of 30'4\" x 16'2\", which suits a long lawn or school ground. Play here builds arm strength, imagination and creativity. Galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope carry a 3-year warranty. Write to sales@funplaysystems.com for a quote.",
